&lt;p style="margin-left: 12px; margin-right: 4px; text-align: justify; text-justify: inter-ideograph"&gt;神戸市中央区に「Casual Dining KICHIRI」第１号店となる「KICHIRI　三宮店」を開店&lt;/p&gt;
